<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT-Australian All Industrials could test trend support.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Australian All Industrials could test trend support.</headline>
<text>
<p>------------------------All Industrials-------------------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 4380 4410 4450 *RSI-14 59.31 *MA-10 4343.9</p>
<p>4320 - 4400  *Sup 4340 4325 4300 *MA-20 4306.3 *MA-40 4270.3</p>
<p>---------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - Aug 5------------------</p>
<p>*Off last week's high</p>
